​​
10th level: Dual-Defense
Starting at 10th level, you can use a reaction to add +5 to your AC

​
14th level: Squad Strike
Starting at 14th level, you can use your Action to summon up to 2 corporate solvers, they act independently of you, but respond to your commands, and both share a turn.

